recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the adoption is landed and GREEN, so the mirror's one live commit is now ordinary tree. Two doors left, both yours: the NixOS switch that seats codex (bash /home/keeper/grain/nixos/rebuild-outer.sh, then ./tools/ag/agent-jail.sh codex login), and the derived-spine key the row-number door has now demanded six times. Gated and unchanged: %291's one-tree-per-star, %295's host-tier shape, and Dream's width ratchet in glow/rune_shape.rye.
